item.neko_hologram_projector.name=Neko Blueprint Hologram Projector
item.neko_hologram_projector.description.0=§7Import a controller structure or §bblueprint§7 and preview its §bhologram§7 in the world.§r
item.neko_hologram_projector.description.1=§7Select world regions to edit §bblueprints§7 or §dcut and move§7 complete structures.§r
item.neko_hologram_projector.description.2=§7Review §fmaterials§7 and changes, then confirm §aBuild§7, §6Replace§7 or §cDismantle§7.§r
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.0=§7§eRight-click§7 opens the projector; §eright-click§7 a real controller to import its structure.§r
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.1=§7While idle in Blueprint mode: select a blueprint and click Place; §eAlt-right-click§7 previews the last blueprint.§r
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.2=§7§eRight-click§7 locks the §agreen§7 preview with §bcyan§7 outlines; §eright-click§7 again to review materials and confirm in the UI.§r
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.3=§7While idle in Blueprint mode: §eShift-right-click§7 chooses Blueprint / Cut selection; hold §eShift§7 and §eright-click§7 to switch, then release §eShift§7.§r
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.4=§7Area: §eShift-right-click§7 again finishes, §eEsc§7 cancels. Locked preview: §eShift-right-click§7 unlocks.§r
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.5=§7UI: §eCtrl-click§7 selects multiple cells, §eShift-drag§7 selects a volume, §eCtrl+X/C/V§7 edits, §eRGB§7 axes move.§r
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.6=§7Normal view: aim at a block to attach; float when no block is hit. §eAlt§7 forces floating.§r
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.7=§7Locked blueprint preview: §earrows§7 nudge relative to the view; §eAlt+Up/Down§7 changes height; hold to repeat slowly, then §eright-click§7 to review again.§r
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.8=§7Moving blueprint in normal view: §eR§7 rotates horizontally; §eCtrl+R§7 rotates vertically.§r
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.9=§7Normal view: §eAlt+scroll§7 adjusts floating distance (§f0–64§7 blocks, 0 at your feet); §escroll§7 switches items.§r
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.10=§7Preview UI: §eWASD§7 moves the camera.§r
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.11=§7After the first complete world selection: §eZ§7 toggles add, §dAlt+Z§7 toggles subtract; repeat to disable. §eShift+Z§7 merges without duplicates; §eCtrl+Z/Y§7 undoes/redoes.§r
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.12=§7While idle in Cut mode: §eright-click / Shift-right-click§7 opens storage; choose an entry there to place; §eAlt-right-click§7 undoes; §dShift+Alt-right-click§7 cuts another region; §eAlt+A/D§7 switches entries.§r
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.13=§7Outside selection: §eCtrl+Shift+right-click§7 opens stored cuts directly.§r
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.14=§7Continuous selection defaults to §eC§7; adds to an existing selection, §dShift+C§7 subtracts. Left-click vertices, click the first to close, then choose/adjust height from a block. Default §eV§7 finishes; world hints show actual bindings.§r
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.15=§7Isometric: §eCtrl+left/right§7 sets corners 1/2; §eShift+left§7 submits. Placement uses §eleft§7 to lock/confirm. §eR+left drag§7 rotates, §eright drag§7 pans, §ewheel§7 zooms, §eX§7 toggles X-ray; §eAlt+wheel§7 adjusts depth.§r
